WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.190
Oh! I'll start again.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:36.190
I'd like to provide you with
an explanation of the Gundam Fight.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.200
It all began in the recent past,
about 60 years ago.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:44.990
People had left the filthy Earth
to live in Colonies in space.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:48.460
And in order to avoid all-out
war among the Colony nations...

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:52.130
...a competition is held every four
years with representatives...

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.880
...from each nation piloting
Gundam machines...

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.340
...in what are known as
"Gundam Fights."

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:59.930
And the pilots fight. And they
fight. And they continue fighting...

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.680
...until the nation represented
by the last standing Gundam...

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:06.770
...earns the right to rule
all the Colony nations.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:11.880
It's as though they've based war
on principles of sportsmanship.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.490
However,
one problem still remains.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.420
This competition takes place
on Earth.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:19.860
That's right.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.870
This filthy planet
on which we live.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.950
But this time around...

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:28.660
...there seems to be something
different about the tournament.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.500
Hey, you over there!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.000
Do you remember seeing this guy?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.760
Well, now...

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:42.010
...how might this photo
affect today's fight?

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:48.350
Neo America - Gundam Maxter

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:46.070
Today's opponent, representing
Neo America, Chibodee Crocket...

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.890
...piloting the Gundam Maxter!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.110
And now!

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:54.150
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:03:00.700
Roar of the Winning Punch!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.500
Greetings to everybody across
Neo America! Listen to this crowd!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:14.540
Life has returned to the
once-quiet city of New York!

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:18.050
And there's only one reason for it!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.710
It's because "the man" has arrived!

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:25.720
The Gundam Maxter,
Neo America's Mobile Fighter.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.060
That's right.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.170
The machine that defeated
the "Scud Gundam"...

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.640
...our avowed enemy
with only one shot.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:38.440
Deep inside its massive body
lies incredible capabilities...

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.820
...virtually guaranteeing victory.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:47.480
It'll bring the championship here
to Neo America this year!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:54.290
Space Colony Neo America

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:53.250
And now, our worthy hero,
the pilot of Gundam Maxter!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.290
His name...

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.840
...Chibodee Crocket!

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.500
Our shining hero!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.630
Now, everyone, let's cheer for him!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.810
Our own...

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:08.060
...Chibodee! Crocket!

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:12.520
...Chibodee! Crocket!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.270
I've returned.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.150
I've returned to this place.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.650
Yes.
This was where my dream began.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:25.660
And now, as a Gundam Fighter...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.320
...the time has come for me
to grab hold of my dream.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.490
With my own hands.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:31.700
Now!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.080
To the Gundam Fighters
of the world!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.500
No one will rise above me!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.500
I am the Champion!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.720
That boy's really grown up.
He sure is something.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.310
You know that man personally?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.680
No. It's just that...

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.890
...he was quite a mischievous brat
around these parts.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.770
Oh...

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.610
Guess he went up to the Colony
and fulfilled his dream.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.150
His dream?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.700
Yeah! His dream!

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.870
If you're strong, you can live well
in the Colony...

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.620
...and even become a hero.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.450
That's why he's our star of hope!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:20.500
My dream is to defeat this guy
no matter what!

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.840
That's all I wish for.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.020
Hey!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.550
I bet you came all this way
to watch the title, right?

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.800
What do you mean?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.680
What? Don't you know?

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.890
The title match between
Earth and the Colonies!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.980
A title match...?

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.560
Chibodee.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:45.070
We were hoping that you'd
avoid your grandstanding.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.440
Hmm? Why?

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.460
The Fighter from Neo Japan...

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.320
...who recently took on Neo Italy's
Neros Gundam...

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.330
...and struck it down
with a single blow.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:58.670
There've been reports that he's
somewhere here in Manhattan.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.420
What's the big deal about
this Shining Gundam, huh?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.840
I'm not one bit worried about him.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.460
What are you saying?

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:10.050
He could be plotting against you.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.390
That's why the Ministry of Defense
is here to protect me, right?

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.430
Anyway...

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.910
...I've got plenty of protection
from my capable crewmembers.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.520
Life's good!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.790
The Colony champion, my ass!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.140
I'll get him!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.080
What the...?!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.420
Who're you?!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.340
Who will be the grand champion?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.090
This is the match of the century.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.720
You got that right!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.060
Look! Here he comes now!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.020
It's him!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.860
The Colony champion,
100 wins in 100 bouts!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.340
Presenting Chibodee Crocket!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.160
Should we just allow him
to do what he wants?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.580
Yes, for the time being.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:22.620
The important thing is to have him
win the Gundam Fight championship...

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:25.080
...and then use that to our advantage.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.190
We'll have to consider him
our star up until that time.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:33.590
After that, I don't care if he
burns out and fades to space dust.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.920
H-hey, that's no fair!
You're a cheater!

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:16.230
It's not the champion!

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.600
It's someone else!

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:21.770
That's the Gundam Fighter
from Neo Japan!

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:25.060
So that's the King of Hearts,
Domon Kasshu!

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.150
Chibodee Crocket!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.900
I challenge you to a Gundam Fight!

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.280
Wh-what did you say?!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.200
You will not refuse me.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.620
Not if you truly claim to be
Neo America's hero.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.700
Don't mess with me!

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.010
What're you waiting for?
Hurry up and catch the guy!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.930
Y-yes, sir!
Let's go!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:10.360
I have challenged you
to a Gundam Fight!

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.940
Hey! Wait!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.360
Hold it!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.860
Get back here!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.620
I'm going to get that guy!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.330
I'll make him pay!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.000
I was humiliated out there!

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.540
Come on, Chibodee,
calm down, all right?

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.630
He made a real fool out of me!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:36.050
Right here in my own hometown!

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.050
I'll settle this with him!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.680
Bunny!
Find out where he is!

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.060
You'll agree to the match?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.560
You're darn right!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.850
I want you to tell him
when and where!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.940
R-right...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.560
Mr. Crocket.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:53.520
How about you leave
that in our hands?

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:58.320
Our assassins will take care of
him as soon as they locate him.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.740
Don't mess with my business!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.290
I'm going to fight that man
in a Gundam Fight match!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.140
Now, just listen...

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.540
Enough with you!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.170
You guys get on my nerves!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:10.880
Get out!

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:12.090
What?

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:13.750
As you wish.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.800
Good luck on your Gundam match.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.470
The little punk's nothing but talk.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.550
We won't rely on him anymore.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:25.830
From now on, we'll have to
do whatever it takes!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:26.390
Yes, sir.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.160
I thought he only grazed me.

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:52.210
He's definitely tough enough
to be a Gundam Fighter.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:03.570
Up against three men
with guns, huh?

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:05.180
This isn't going to be easy.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.360
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.420
All right, guys. Even a stun rifle
can pack a punch.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.380
Let's get out of here!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.550
Are you okay?

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.910
What's the matter?
What're you doing here?

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.490
I was just dreaming.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:07.530
Dreaming?

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.410
Yeah, I was dreaming.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.570
All of my dreams...
This was where it all began.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.590
When I was a boy, we were poor...

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.510
...and it was a struggle
just to live in this city.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:26.220
During those lonely days when
nobody would help me...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:30.060
...I'd look up in the sky and
dream of seeing the Colony.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.600
All I thought about was
how to become stronger.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:35.940
Then...

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:46.200
...while I was running around
one day, some guys scouted me...

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.580
...and I finally got to see the
Colony I'd dreamt about.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.200
That's when I realized...

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.000
...that a dream is something you
can grasp with your own hands.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.290
That's why I'll do what I have to.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.710
I'm going to be the
Gundam champion...

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:03.130
...and carry the dream of
the people of this city.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.470
If you set your mind to it...

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.990
...dreams don't just end up
as dreams.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:09.540
I'll show them all.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.180
And I'll do it with these fists!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.280
Come, Neo Japan!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.240
Where am I?

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.250
Well, where do you think we are?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.000
The answer is New York.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.290
On downtown's skid row.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.210
And?

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.380
Who am I?

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.720
You're Rain.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.390
You're right.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.640
Don't move.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.890
Good!

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.930
No other injuries.
You're okay now.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.100
But you're overdoing it, you know.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.310
Leave me alone...!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.060
Preventative medicine, just in case.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.790
But seriously,
you have to be more careful.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:13.010
This is a city where
only the strong survive.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:15.950
I'm really worried.

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:20.630
But I do believe that Chibodee
is somewhat different...

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.090
Who are you?

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.760
I've a message from Chibodee.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.370
"I will accept your challenge."

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.780
"Meet me at eight on Broadway."

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:35.560
That's all.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.900
Our men failed to
get rid of Domon Kasshu!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.650
How are things going with you?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.320
It went smoothly.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.910
The girl came in handy.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.910
The rest is going according to plan.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.210
I overslept!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.170
Did Domon take off ahead of me?!

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:07.050
What could've happened to him?

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.630
It's now the starting time
of this match...

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:12.300
...but the Neo Japan Fighter hasn't
appeared at Brooklyn Stadium!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.850
What?! But that girl told us "Broadway"!

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:16.760
Then Domon must be...!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.310
What's the matter,
Neo Japan?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.980
Suddenly afraid of me?

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.470
That's strange.
Where could he be?

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:28.900
Domon Kasshu.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.860
I've been waiting for you.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:35.260
I'll make this your graveyard!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.960
What was that?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.250
The area over there is uninhabited.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.790
Chibodee Crocket!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.580
What's your problem?

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.760
How dare you use one of your girls
to trick Domon!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.760
What?!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.220
What's going on?

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:56.850
A battle?!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.650
I see! It's Douglas and them!

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:01.140
Messing with my business...!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.650
How much more of a fool
are they going to make me into?!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.190
Janet!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.190
Cath! Shirley!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:07.860
Let's go!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.940
Gundam Maxter, initiate
the mobile trace system!

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:23.710
That man...

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.250
You're not getting away!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.470
We'll be invited to the Colony...

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.260
...once we eliminate you!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.140
What?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.810
I'm here to fight you!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.480
Hurry up and get
in your Gundam!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.060
Core Lander!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.860
Gundam!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.600
Mobile Trace System checking
brainwaves, blood pressure...

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.150
...pulse, respiration, temperature,
metabolism. All green.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.300
H-how did he get there?!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:05.310
Go!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.790
Nice move, Neo Japan!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.210
Chibodee! What's the big idea?!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.960
We're on your side!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.010
Shut up!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.340
You guys are an embarrassment
to Neo America!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.340
We'll get rid of you as well!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.270
Shoot!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.940
How did he...?!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.700
Hey, Neo Japan!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.580
I don't like the way
things have started out.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.450
So, let me be the one to
challenge you to a Gundam Fight.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.330
Will you accept?!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:11.670
Of course!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.670
Then here I go!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.760
What?!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.430
Gundam Fight!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.020
Ready...!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.980
...Go!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.570
Wha...?!
I'm losing on strength?!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.620
Chibodee Crocket!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.540
There's something I
want to ask you!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.000
What?!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.000
Do you know this man?!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.540
Stop messing around!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.130
We're fighting a battle!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.590
I see.

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:01.670
Guess it's not very likely a guy
like you would know this man.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:02.680
In that case...

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:07.760
The ultimate Shining Finger!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.270
Oh, my God!

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.770
No! No!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:37.000
What's the matter?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.840
Why don't you finish me off?

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.920
Seems I can't do that.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:45.050
Takin' pity on me?
Is that it?

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.430
You know...

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:49.850
...I know this time around,
I really embarrassed this city.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:50.640
Yeah.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:56.260
My dream's now over with,
along with my right arm.

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:01.820
Hey, they're all...

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.400
Chibodee! Please stand up!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.280
Please!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.530
Stand up, one more time!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:10.280
You represent our
hopes and dreams!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:14.000
Please don't ever give up,
Chibodee!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:20.630
All of you...

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.300
What'll you do?

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:26.380
Article 3 of the Gundam Fight
International Regulations...

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.470
..."as long as the dream of winning
remains with the Fighter...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.680
...the Fighter may challenge...

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.750
...the championship league
as often as he desires."

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.570
I see.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.520
So, I can start all over in this city.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:42.030
And I'll keep challenging
as many times as it takes...

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.860
...until I'm able to recapture
this city's dreams!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.490
And I'll do it with these fists!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.700
I will be back!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.460
Domon Kasshu!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.460
Today, I know I lost to you!

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.790
But I'll pay you back one day!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.090
That's for sure!

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:06.050
You're one of the good guys,
Chibodee Crocket.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:08.890
Thank you!

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:36.250
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:40.710
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:44.250
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:51.430
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:57.140
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:57.350 --> 00:23:02.400
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:08.950
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:13.070
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:19.080
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:32.930
It's the moment you've
been waiting for.

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:35.810
The Dragon Gundam and its
gang terrorize the villagers.

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:39.600
And in order to challenge
the Fighter, Sai Saici...

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.730
...Domon begins his pursuit.

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:45.610
However, thanks to an annoying
kid he meets along the way...

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:49.030
...Domon finds himself in
incredible danger!

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:52.280
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:55.370
Beat the Dragon Gundam.

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:59.710
Beat the Dragon Gundam

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:58.250
Beat the Dragon Gundam
Ready! Go!
